@startuml
title Student Ordering Main Flow — Activity DRAFT
start
:Browse active merchants and listed items;
:Search, sort or filter catalog as needed;
:Select available items and valid options;
:Add items to cart;
:Edit quantities, options or notes as needed;
if (Ready to submit?) then (yes)
  :Sign in as student;
  :Set pickup time for each merchant suborder;
  :Revalidate merchant, item, option and same-day future pickup time;
  :Check quantity-mode totals and manual-mode sellable status;
  if (Any validation fails?) then (yes)
    :Show reason and retain cart;
    stop
  else (no)
    if (Base price, option surcharge or fixed discount changed?) then (yes)
      :Show updated breakdown and total;
      if (Student confirms updated amount?) then (yes)
      else (no)
        :Retain cart;
        stop
      endif
    endif
    :Atomically create one order and one suborder per merchant and deduct quantity-mode stock;
    if (Atomic operation succeeds?) then (yes)
      :Return parent order ID;
      :Clear cart;
      if (Same confirmed submission is retried?) then (yes)
        :Return the same result without another order or stock deduction;
      endif
    else (no)
      :Create no order, deduct no stock, show reason and retain cart;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Continue browsing or editing cart;
endif
stop

note right
  Requirements: FR-03–FR-05, FR-11–FR-25
  Amount-change confirmation covers base price, option surcharge and fixed discount (FR-23).
  Declining the changed amount retains the cart and stops submission.
end note
@enduml
@startuml
title Administrator Merchant Account Management — Sequence DRAFT
actor Administrator
actor Merchant
participant "Administration System" as AdminUI
participant "Ordering System" as System
participant "Merchant Account Store" as MerchantAccounts
participant "Administrator Account Store" as AdministratorAccounts

Administrator -> AdminUI: Sign in
Administrator -> AdminUI: Add merchant from basic information
AdminUI -> System: Create merchant account
System -> MerchantAccounts: Save merchant account
MerchantAccounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Return account credentials
AdminUI -> Merchant: Deliver account credentials

Administrator -> AdminUI: Edit or deactivate merchant
AdminUI -> System: Update merchant account
System -> MerchantAccounts: Save merchant state
MerchantAccounts --> System: Updated merchant
System --> AdminUI: Show result

Administrator -> AdminUI: Add administrator account
AdminUI -> System: Create administrator account
System -> AdministratorAccounts: Save administrator account
AdministratorAccounts --> System: Account created
System --> AdminUI: Show result

note over Administrator,AdministratorAccounts
  Requirements: FR-02, FR-03–FR-05, FR-22, FR-26, FR-32
  Merchant basic-information fields remain Unconfirmed.
end note
note over AdminUI,Merchant
  Requirements: FR-02
  The created merchant account credentials are delivered to the merchant.
end note
@enduml

